Subject: [PATCH 47/49] tdxnavlib: New dll implementing the 3Dconnexion
 navigation library on top of spacenavd.

LOCAL, not for upstream: TDxNavLib.dll is part of the 3Dconnexion 3DxWare
driver. Applications also check HKLM\Software\3Dconnexion\3DxWare\Version
and the TDxInput type library registration before using it.

Settings in HKCU\Software\Wine\TDxNavLib: TranslationSpeed, RotationSpeed,
AxisSigns and AxisMap.

